 "notes": [
  "The published title contains a crude word ('Bittch'), so this page is titled Alex George DS; the post's title is kept in the source citation as published.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (6)': Ralltiir Operations / In The Hands Of The Empire (posted 'ROPS'), Ralltiir ('Raaltiir'), Prepared Defenses ('Prep. Def.'), There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement ('TINT/OE'), Mobilization Points ('Mob. Points'), Imperial Arrest Order ('IAO'); these count toward the 60. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Ralltiir, Swamp, Forest, Jungle and Speeder Bike dested the Dark pages (Ralltiir (Dark) etc.). 'Exec. Docking Bay' dested Executor: Docking Bay; 'DS2 Docking Bay' Death Star II: Docking Bay.",
  "Posted 'Epp Vader' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'DVDLOTS' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Mara Jade TEH' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Iggy With Gun' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'Admiral Piet' Admiral Piett; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'Zuckuss in ship' / 'Bossk in ship' / 'Boba in ship' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter / Bossk In Hound's Tooth / Boba Fett In Slave I; 'Lat Damage' Lateral Damage; 'Evader/Monnok' Evader & Monnok; 'Omni Box/Its Worse' Ommni Box & It's Worse.",
  "Secret Plans is the Special Edition Effect (not a Defensive Shield in 2001).",
  "The post's updates suggest Desert for Jungle and Tempest Scout 1 for Tempest Scout 3; the list is kept as published. The post also mentions a BHBM conversion ('Bring Her Before Me The Virgin Penetration', DeckTech 14788).",
